give @s written_book[written_book_content={title:"Book of Rituals",author:"Loxec",generation:1,resolved:true,pages:[{"text":"Welcome future ghost ! \n This book will teach you everything about ghost to become one or chase all of them ! \n \n \n Ghosts are really powerfull but it's really difficult to become one \n \n lets start"},{"text":"  Rite of Conjuring \n \n The rite of Conjuring is a ritual that will turn you into a ghost, infortunately it's very difficult to setup \n \n Ingredients: \n * 4 soul sand \n * 4 crying obsidian \n * 4 soul lantern \n * 1 mycelium \n * 1 wither rose","color":"black"},{"text":"  Rite of Conjuring:\n       Setup\n\nTo make the ritual hotel , place soul sand in a cross shape living a hole in the middle for the mycelium, on the corners place crying obsidian, place soul lantern on each soul sand, finally place a wither rose on the mycelium"},{"text":" Rite of Conjuring:\n  Transformation\n\nPut on a leather chestplate enchanted with Curse of Sacrifice and then jump on the wither rose\n\n\nDone! You're now a ghost"},{"text":"     Banishing\n\nBanishing is an enchantment that apply on any types of swords, the Banishing enchantment is used to transform ghosts into their vulnerable form, one hit and they become vulnerable "},{"text":"      Cursing\n\nCursing is a new enchantment, it's applied to echo shard and you can only found the enchanted book in certain structure \n\nWhen hit by an echo shard with cursing, you become a ghost if you aren't weak or a vulnerable ghost"},{"text":"  Rite of Repulsion\n\nThe Rite of Repulsion is a ritual that protect an area of 20 block radius by doing damage to ghosts\nIngredients:\n- 1 Block of Lapis lazuli\n- 1 Glowing item frame\n- 1 Echo shard\n- 1 Wand of Concentration"},{"text":"  Rite of Repulsion:\n       Setup\nFirst thing first, enchant the echo shard with Cursing, then place the lapis lazuli block, on top of it place a glowing item frame with the echo shard inside, finally, hit the lapis lazuli block with your Wand of Concentration"},{"text":"      Wand Of \n  Concentration\nThis wand only has 1 purpose for now but it will be usefull on the future, to craft it, imbue a stick with 8 prismarine shard in the crafting table"}]}] 1